  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "2026 marks the debut of Sonny Fodera in the Top 100 DJs list and, by most measures, it’s long overdue. The London-based Australian DJ and producer has had a banner year, headlining Creamfields, holding down a Pacha residency, and touring across the globe. But if that wasn’t enough to keep Fodera busy, he’s also had some major hits from the studio.\n\nIt was a busy release schedule, but it doesn’t get much better than his tune ‘Asking’, made with the legendary MK and a vocal assist from Clementine Douglas. With another world tour on the horizon and more festivals to headline, Fodera isn’t slowing down anytime soon.",
